### Requisições prontas para a extensão REST Client (VS Code) ou IntelliJ HTTP Client.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Criar pedido (troque a chave a cada pedido novo)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f8c1d2e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

{ "customerEmail": "cliente@exemplo.com", "amount": "199.90" }

### Repetir a mesma chave → 409 transação duplicada (details.originalOrderId)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f8c1d2e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

{ "customerEmail": "cliente@exemplo.com", "amount": "199.90" }

### Mesma chave, corpo diferente → 422
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f8c1d2e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

{ "customerEmail": "cliente@exemplo.com", "amount": "1.00" }

### Sem Idempotency-Key → 400
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerEmail": "cliente@exemplo.com", "amount": "199.90" }

### Validação → 400 com os campos
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6f8c1d2e-0000-4000-8000-000000000099

{ "customerEmail": "nao-e-email", "amount": 199.9 }

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Visão geral (painel)
GET {{base}}/debug/overview

### Outbox
GET {{base}}/debug/outbox?limit=20

### Tópicos no broker
GET {{base}}/debug/topics

### Ligar falha de publicação
PUT {{base}}/debug/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "failPublish": true }

### Desligar todas as falhas
PUT {{base}}/debug/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "failPublish": false, "failConsumer": false, "crashAfterPublish": false }

### Webhook: cadastrar endpoint (guarde o "secret" da resposta)
POST {{base}}/webhooks/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "http://localhost:3000/demo-receiver", "description": "Loja (demo)", "events": ["order.confirmed", "webhook.test"] }

### Webhook: listar endpoints
GET {{base}}/webhooks/endpoints

### Webhook: enviar teste (troque o id)
POST {{base}}/webhooks/endpoints/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/test

### Webhook: últimas entregas
GET {{base}}/webhooks/deliveries

### Webhook: entrega com tentativas (troque o id)
GET {{base}}/webhooks/deliveries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Webhook: reenviar (troque o id)
POST {{base}}/webhooks/deliveries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/retry

### Teste de atomicidade
POST {{base}}/debug/atomicity-test
